// ZNULL - helper: null space basis from an RREF produced by prgmZRREF.
// In : [J] (RREF), W, R, ʟPIV, ʟISP (all as left by ZRREF)
// Out: [I] = W x F matrix whose columns are a basis of the null space of the first
//      W columns (each free variable set to 1 in turn), F = nullity = W-R.
//      If F=0, [I] is the W x 1 zero vector.
// Uses: I J K
W-R→F
{W,max(1,F)}→dim([I])
Fill(0,[I])
0→K
For(J,1,W)
If not(ʟISP(J)):Then
K+1→K
1→[I](J,K)
For(I,1,R)
⁻[J](I,J)→[I](ʟPIV(I),K)
End
End
End
